{
  "email": "priya.nair@brightline.example",
  "reason": "Ticket EVAL-net-06: office internet reported down. Checking sender's account, devices, and usual hours first."
}

{
  "hostname": "BL-LT-0103",
  "reason": "Checking whether sender's laptop is online and whether it has a path to the internet, to separate a laptop problem from an office network outage (KB-014 quick check)."
}

{
  "summary": "P1: Office-wide internet outage reported by Priya Nair (IT Manager, BL-LT-0103). User says the whole floor has lost internet and nobody can work. Checked: account is active, not blocked, no failed logins, VPN access true. Device BL-LT-0103 shows online with a recent check-in (2026-10-11 03:07 UTC), no warnings, 62.5% disk free. The laptop is reachable by management, so the fault looks like loss of internet egress at the office network rather than the laptop. Not yet confirmed: whether other floor users and the office Wi-Fi/wired network are all affected, and whether the outage is at the ISP, the edge firewall, or the core switch. KB-014 says to escalate when the office network is down for several people. Needs Tier 2 network investigation of the office internet circuit and edge device.",
  "reason": "Office-wide outage affecting several users; triage marks it P1 and KB-014 escalation criteria are met. Tier 1 cannot fix network infrastructure."
}

{
  "outcome": "escalated",
  "reply_to_user": "Hi Priya, I'm sorry the office has lost internet. Because it affects the whole floor, I've escalated this to our Tier 2 network team as a priority. Your laptop is showing as online and connected to our systems, so the problem looks like the office internet connection itself rather than your device. While you wait, if you have a phone, you can try a hotspot on your laptop to confirm whether the laptop can get out. Please reply with anything you notice, such as whether the Wi-Fi shows 'No internet' or the wired connection is also down, and whether colleagues on other floors are affected.",
  "internal_note": "Triage P1 office-wide internet outage. Checked lookup_user: priya.nair (user_id 3) active, not blocked, 0 failed logins, VPN access true, device BL-LT-0103. check_device_status BL-LT-0103: online, last check-in 2026-10-11 03:07 UTC, no warnings, disk 62.5% free, so the laptop is not the cause. Escalated to Tier 2 (escalation_id 1) per KB-014 'Escalate when office network is down for several people'. Still to confirm for Tier 2: whether other floor users are affected, status of the ISP circuit, and the edge firewall or core switch. Printer (KB-022) and VPN (KB-016) were not checked because the report is internet loss, not a printer or VPN issue.",
  "kb_articles": [
    "KB-014"
  ],
  "confidence": "high"
}
